{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nInspect summary for the selected container or image (`docker inspect`).\n\n## Spec\n- Container: Id, Name, Image, Created, State (status, started/finished, exit code, health), RestartPolicy, Mounts (source → destination, mode), Ports (host → container), Networks (name, IP), Labels\n- Image: Id, RepoTags, Created, Size, Architecture/OS, Cmd/Entrypoint, exposed ports, Labels\n- **`Config.Env` is never rendered** — environment variables are treated as secrets\n- Rendered as sections with the same key/value styling as the GitHub detail header; scrollable\n\nPart of #87.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:14Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":91,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Docker: detail pane"}
